Test rg35 (XFAIL): a variables block that runs past the bank must still fail
// setVarsPC places the implicit block, and it bound-checks separately from
// the directive rules, so it needs its own negative case. Two variables
// starting at 07777 put the second at 010000.
        var topvar, overvar
100/
beg,    dio topvar
        dio overvar
07777/
        variables
stop
